    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>今天的嘉宾是我的老朋友【王巧嘴】，每次他来到节目都很欢乐，这次也不例外！快来听听我们那些年在彩虹社交软件上的趣事吧！记得评论、分享和点赞哦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【投稿邮箱】caihongweiguang@163.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>用分享点亮微光，让我们看见不同的彩虹人生。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期节点】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="96">01:36</a> &nbsp;</span></strong><span>从Fridae等网站说起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="240">04:00</a> &nbsp;不要轻易为一个人而改变自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="627">10:27</a> &nbsp;相约喝醉，抱抱睡</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="822">13:42</a> &nbsp;那些被“照骗”的经历</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1068">17:48</a> &nbsp;有个0.5对我说:这么晚了 凑合凑合得了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1276">21:16</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;软件里同样有靠谱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1401">23:21</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于“先X后爱”未必是坏事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;约会迟到居然被惩罚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2052">34:12</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;关于软件上的年龄焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2357">39:17</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;“中登们”给年轻朋友的建议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2503">41:43</a> &nbsp;&nbsp;我在交友软件上遇到亲戚</span></p><span></span><p><span>·节目主理人丨斯坦尼Rainbow （视频账号也叫“微光斯坦尼”、“斯坦尼和朋友们”、“斯坦尼一家”）</span></p><span></span><p><span>·本期嘉宾丨王巧嘴</span></p><span></span><p><span>·剪辑、后期丨流年</span></p>]]></description>
